# OWASP Top 10 - A02:2021 Cryptographic Failures
# Exposition de données sensibles

### Sensitive Data in URL
GET /api/users?ssn=123-45-6789&credit_card=4532123456789012 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Unencrypted HTTP for sensitive data
POST /login HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Length: 35

username=admin&password=SuperSecret

### Weak encryption - MD5 hash
POST /api/auth HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 58

{"username": "admin", "password_hash": "5f4dcc3b5aa765d61d8327deb882cf99"}

### Backup file exposure
GET /database.sql.bak HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Config file exposure
GET /config.php.old HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Source code exposure
GET /app.py.swp HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Certificate validation bypass attempt
GET /api/data HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
X-Forwarded-Proto: http
